From: Ramprasad <ramprasadgoud34@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 15:54:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] fix(contracts): desk pays surplus to the borrower,
 enforces jewellery reserve floor, effects before transfers

Settlement credits the bank its dues and the borrower any surplus, as the RBI
gold and silver directions require. Jewellery reserve price must be at least
90% of the bank's value. Redeem and bid update state before pulling money
(Slither reentrancy-no-eth triage). Registry caches the loop length.
---
 contracts/src/assets/AssetRegistry.sol    |  5 +++--
 contracts/src/assets/BankAssetDesk.sol    | 24 ++++++++++++++++++-----
 contracts/test/assets/BankAssetDesk.t.sol | 19 ++++++++++++++++--
 3 files changed, 39 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/contracts/src/assets/AssetRegistry.sol b/contracts/src/assets/AssetRegistry.sol
index 1460f52..e91933b 100644
--- a/contracts/src/assets/AssetRegistry.sol
+++ b/contracts/src/assets/AssetRegistry.sol
@@ -110,8 +110,9 @@ contract AssetRegistry is Ownable {
 
     /// @notice Proof of reserve for every listed metal, one call for the app.
     function allReserves() external view returns (MetalReserveView[] memory list) {
-        list = new MetalReserveView[](codes.length);
-        for (uint256 i; i < codes.length; ++i) {
+        uint256 n = codes.length;
+        list = new MetalReserveView[](n);
+        for (uint256 i; i < n; ++i) {
             list[i] = reserveOf(codes[i]);
         }
     }
diff --git a/contracts/src/assets/BankAssetDesk.sol b/contracts/src/assets/BankAssetDesk.sol
